  "details": "When testing multiple clients with WorldSDK(3.6.1), multiple players of my account are displayed in the test instance, but when I change the avatar of one of them to another, the other players change their avatars to the same avatar in sync.\n\nPreviously, only the player who made the avatar change would change avatars.\n\nSince it is difficult to distinguish between players when testing, I would like to see the ability to change only one avatar, or to make it easier to distinguish between players.\n\nAs a side note, it seems that the scale can be changed individually, but that makes it a little difficult to distinguish between the two.",
